{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026nSPlvPLew01792991048.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產馬鞍山迎海御峰分行資深區域營業經理胡耀祖表示，近日市況向好，馬鞍山新港城本月暫錄3宗成交，屋苑最新錄Q座中層02室，實用面積337平方呎，2房間隔，開價約520萬元，議價後以515萬元易手，實用平均呎15,282元。</p><p><br/>中原胡耀祖指，新買家為上車客，見單位間隔合用，價錢合理，即決定入市單位自用。據了解，原業主於2007年以130萬元購入單位，持貨約19年，是次轉手賬面上獲利約385萬元或296%離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:01:24.601727+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T15:18:31.772206+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:58:26.519747+00:00","content_hash":"40a83fe144f5479cc687d4fdc68fce77d5ac3057c55664f95dc4366025d3d38f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}